  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Connect business-critical processes to Microsoft Azure",
    "splashDescription": "Bring the power of serverless computing into business processes that are orchestrated and automated by Camunda. Directly invoke Microsoft Azure Serverless functions from Camunda-based processes. Whether it's data processing, third-party integrations, or any form of compute task, you can trigger Azure functions without leaving the Camunda environment.\n\nETA: 30.06.2024",
